OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for indoor waste site       
OL,4,Aapproved                               
OL,6,FPlans for a new indoor waste processing
OL,7,Fplant have been approved by a council. 
OL,9,FThe facility, near High Wycombe, was   
OL,10,Fgiven the go-ahead by Buckinghamshire  
OL,11,FCouncil's Strategic Sites Committee.   
OL,13,FIt was approved unanimously, subject to
OL,14,Famendments to several planning         
OL,15,Fconditions.                            
